+    body: Mixed serving on one 8-card 950PR node uses 4 of 8 NPUs (DP4+EP). FP8 (Preview) runs MTP k=1, same command as 950DT; FP8 (0731) runs DSpark k=5. Pin quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:v0.23.0-a5 and set HCCL_BUFFSIZE=1024 before launch. DeepSeek-V4 on 950 also needs the indexer quant_mode fix in vllm-project/vllm-ascend#16104 — without it the image the tag currently ships aborts during warmup with QuantLightningIndexerV2 EZ0021.
